warning: this `UDim2.new` can be written as `UDim2.fromScale`
 --> Roblox:1:11
1 | local u = UDim2.new(0.5, 0, 1, 0)
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use `UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 1)`
fix: replace with `UDim2.fromScale`
  | local u = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 1)

warning: this `UDim2.new` can be written as `UDim2.fromOffset`
 --> Roblox:1:11
1 | local u = UDim2.new(0, 100, 0, 200)
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use `UDim2.fromOffset(100, 200)`
fix: replace with `UDim2.fromOffset`
  | local u = UDim2.fromOffset(100, 200)

warning: this `UDim2.new` can be written as `UDim2.fromOffset`
 --> Roblox:1:11
1 | local u = UDim2.new(0, -100, 0, 0x20)
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use `UDim2.fromOffset(-100, 0x20)`
fix: replace with `UDim2.fromOffset`
  | local u = UDim2.fromOffset(-100, 0x20)

warning: this `UDim2.new` can be written as `UDim2.fromScale`
 --> Roblox:1:11
1 | local u = UDim2.new(0.5, --[[no offset]] 0, 1, 0)
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use `UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 1)`
